first_planning.user_prompt_template:
Task goal
{task_goal}

Chronological demonstration followed by the new execution state
{current_observations}

Infer and lock exactly one demonstrated strategy. Generate its concrete ordered subgoal_sequence, then repeat its first entry as next_subgoal_key, next_subgoal, and arguments. Do not output action_name. Output JSON only.

followup_planning.user_prompt_template:
Task goal
{task_goal}

Locked video-derived subgoal list; required planning reference
{video_subgoal_list}

Compact Task State
{task_state}

Current execution
- Key: {current_subgoal_key}
- Subgoal: {current_subgoal}
- Acceptance criteria: {acceptance_criteria}
- Verification parameters: {verification_parameters}

Subgoal-start observations
{subgoal_start_observations}

Recent observations, oldest to newest
{recent_observations}

Current subgoal sequence
{current_subgoal_sequence}

Verify the current subgoal and select what should be active next in the same response. Base planning on task goal together with video_subgoal_list and never substitute a different strategy. Do not output action_name. Output JSON only.
